  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel/files/4132623\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2版本需安装CITADEL 2.1.1或更高版本</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>1.16.5版本需安装CITADEL 1.8.1或更高版本</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/llibrary\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>1.12.2版本需安装LLIB 1.7.19或更高版本<br><br></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.12.2版本已不再提供支持！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>原作者FiskFille发布页：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2550986-the-morbid-reborn-new-boss-with-epic-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2550986-the-morbid-reborn-new-boss-with-epic-animations</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>授权说明：</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3SYgYXQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"735\" height=\"215\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">模组介绍：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iitTHNg.png\" alt=\"收割者图片\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">收割者是极其强大且致命的生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每次攻击可恢复2.5颗心的生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若对其造成过多伤害，它将进入格挡状态。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">格挡期间处于完全无敌状态。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">死亡时会向空中散射致命箭矢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这些箭矢可造成超过200点伤害</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6YAgXBD.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是它的手臂武器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可通过击败收割者获得。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">具有40点以上的超高伤害。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如何在生存模式召唤？<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oRuU6J5.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如图摆放黑曜石与凋零骷髅头颅，手持下界之星右击凋零骷髅头颅即可召唤</span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
